Termlet 的系统与品牌标志取自 Simple Icons 16.36.0（https://simpleicons.org，https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons）。
The system and brand logos in Termlet are from Simple Icons 16.36.0.

这些标志是各自所有者的商标，Termlet 只用它们标明主机运行的系统、本机的 shell 与发起请求的程序，不表示与这些所有者有任何关联或得到其认可。
These logos are trademarks of their respective owners. Termlet uses them only to identify the system a host runs, the local shell and the program making a request; this does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by those owners.

Simple Icons 整体以 CC0 1.0 发布（原文附在最后）；个别标志另有许可，见下表中的作者、来源与协议。
Simple Icons is released under CC0 1.0 (full text at the end); some logos have their own licenses: see the author, source and license listed for them below.

标志原样使用（只去掉 SVG 中的标题等元数据），以界面的文字颜色或品牌色单色显示；“彩色”风格下品牌色在背景上看不清时会调亮或调暗。按 CC BY-SA 提供的标志，调整了颜色的版本同样按该协议提供。
The logos are used as-is (only metadata such as the SVG title is removed) and drawn in a single color: the interface text color or the brand color, which in the "color" style is lightened or darkened when it is hard to see on the background. For logos under CC BY-SA, such color-adjusted versions are likewise provided under the same license.

